1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,530
(Sheldon:)the original purpose
of the appendix, Leonard?

2
00:00:02,530 --> 00:00:03,630
(Sheldon:)No.

3
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:05,810
(Sheldon:)I do. And yet I'm doomed

4
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:07,480
(Sheldon:)while you live on.

5
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:11,650
(Leonard:)Funny how things
work out, isn't it?

6
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:15,360
(Sheldon:)Oh, Lord, I think
it's about to burst!

7
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:20,440
(Sheldon:)On the other hand,

8
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:23,160
(Sheldon:)it might have been
the Brussels sprouts.

9
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:27,970
(Leonard:)Good night.

10
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,620
(Sheldon:)Appendicitis.

11
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:32,310
(Sheldon:)What a nervous Nelly.

12
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:36,930
Penny! Penny!

13
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:38,680
Penny!

14
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:41,600
(Penny:)Coming, coming.

15
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,520
(Penny:)Hey, nice knees.

16
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:44,600
(Leonard:)Thank you.

17
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:45,640
(Sheldon:)They're my mother's.

18
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:48,160
(Penny:)Oh.
And the Flash
shirt is what?

19
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,160
Because, what,
you're gonna run really fast?

20
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,910
(Sheldon:)No, the Flash shirt is
because it's Friday,

21
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:55,360
(Sheldon:)but it's nice when
things work out.

22
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:57,450
(Sheldon:)Where's your
heart rate monitor?
I don't have one.

23
00:00:57,450 --> 00:00:59,250
(Sheldon:)What about your pedometer?
Don't have one.

24
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:01,790
(Sheldon:)Do you have telematics
in your shoes connected
to an iPod?

